sLegacy", "__v55EchoBreakQueue", "numberOutputInner1", "currentArenaPlayer", "Electric Discharge", "branchPersistencia", "KRINBUFFM10UNDYING", "__rwAncestorsCheck", "numberSpacingKrin", "KRINBUFFM10EXPOSE", "__v10MarkedSerial", "__v55ApplyCourage", "moveD_final_para", "KrinFilterShadow", "previousBattleSp", "__v10UndyingUsed", "__a3StatusLayout", "__v55PrevExecute", "__p2TooltipGuard", "addMoveForPlayer", "__rwExtraPending", "progressLevelOn", "parallelFilterA", "ScriptEnderKAIA", "buffTickChecker", "KrinFilterFrost", "exportPvPArrayX", "KrinFilterFlame", "KrinFilterFocus", "Poison Overload", "Vascular Arrest", "Dead Man\'s Plea", "Electron Charge", "KRINBUFFM10WIND", "__v55RestorePen", "__p2StatusValid", "__rwCrippleTurn", "__zsBotonNativo", "This character has increased defence at the expense of speed.", "Strength, Instinct and Speed +", "__a4TrainSavedSpeeches", "__v55PrevPaintStatuses", "__a35PreviousProgress", "__a4TrainSpeechRecord", "__v55FrozenAfterEnemy", "__rwHuntOrFreezeEvent", "Clemons The Deceiver", "Once per battle, survive lethal damage with 1 Health and gain a shield for 10% maximum Health for 1 turn. Further hits may still kill you.", "Bleeding enemies gain Scent after attacking, once per action. Up to 2 marks for 3 turns. Marks empower hunting talents and Echo Ward.", "Protect another ally for 2 turns. Redirect 35% of direct Health damage to yourself. Redirected damage cannot be redirected again.", "Deal 70% Instinct as Ice damage to all living enemies. They bleed for 25% Instinct for 2 turns. Does not stack.", "Consume up to 2 Scent marks on an enemy. Shield living allies for 60% Instinct plus 70% per mark for 2 turns.", "Living companions deal 10% more direct damage to enemies with Scent. Does not grant additional attacks.", "Deal 160% Instinct as Ice damage. Extend an existing Rake bleed by 1 turn, up to its maximum duration.", "Gain 15% additional penetration per Scent mark on your target, up to 30%. Does not modify Iron Jaws.", "Your Rake bleed lasts 1 additional turn. Reapplying refreshes its duration instead of stacking.", "Deal 180% Strength as Physical damage. Deal 75% more damage against a target below 30% Health.", "Deal 115% Strength as Physical damage. Deal 30% more damage against a target without Scent.", "When an enemy becomes Hunted or is frozen solid, all your cooldowns drop by 1 turn.", "Deal 60% Strength as Physical damage and remove one removable beneficial effect.", "Deal 110% Strength as Physical damage and reduce Speed by 25% for 3 turns.", "Restore 30% of maximum Health. Deal 25% less damage until your next turn.", "Heal one ally for 170% Instinct and remove one removable harmful effect.", "Recover 6 Focus per Scent mark consumed by Echo Ward, up to 12 per cast.", "An ally below 30% Health is healed a second time for 50% of the amount.", "Take 25% less periodic Health damage. Does not remove harmful effects.", "Take 65% less damage and deal 50% less damage until your next turn.", "Freezing an enemy solid shields you for 15% of your maximum Health.", "Gain 25% additional Physical Defence against direct attacks.", "Reduce Physical Defence by 30% for 3 turns. Does not stack.", "% more damage for each \'Frostbite\' on the target (up to ", "% of the wolf\'s Strength as Physical damage per turn.", "Receive 20% more healing, including gradual healing.", "The next ordinary technique with recharge gains ", "Cannot use abilities that cost Focus.", " This character feels integrated!", "Necesitas 1 punto de habilidad.", "Call your ancestors to take your body for 3 turns (\'Ancestral Form\'): you deal 100% more damage, direct and over time, and take 25% less. Heals 65% of your maximum Health, recovers all your Focus, and you act again at once. The ally with the lowest Health receives \'Ancestors\' Blessing\' for 3 turns: if it falls, an ancestral wolf takes its place.", "Mokoshotar descends from the first wolves of the eternal winter, and its ancestors still hunt at its side. Every ability raised to its maximum rank awakens a Mastery effect, marked with a star. While you have at least 1 point in Scent of Blood, your Health, Strength, Instinct and Speed are permanently increased by 10%.", "Call an endless winter for 3 turns. At the start of each of their turns, every enemy gains 2 \'Frostbite\' and has 30% less Speed. You gain 5 \'Ice Shards\' and they do not expire while it lasts. Enemies frozen solid stay frozen for 2 turns (1 against bosses). When the winter ends, all Frostbite shatters for ", "Stand guard over an ally, redirecting 40% of the direct damage it receives to you for 2 turns and shielding you for 220% of your Strength or 310% of your Instinct, whichever is higher. Consumes up to 2 Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy: each increases the shield by 35% and the duration by 1 turn.", "Stand guard over an ally, redirecting 30% of the direct damage it receives to you for 2 turns and shielding you for 170% of your Strength or 240% of your Instinct, whichever is higher. Consumes up to 2 Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy: each increases the shield by 35% and the duration by 1 turn.", "Rally an ally with a thunderous call, healing it for 360% of your Strength or 505% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, increased by 10% for each Scent of Blood and Frostbite on all enemies, up to 80%. Removes 2 harmful effect(s), and its next direct attack deals 25% additional damage.", "Rally an ally with a thunderous call, healing it for 310% of your Strength or 435% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, increased by 10% for each Scent of Blood and Frostbite on all enemies, up to 80%. Removes 1 harmful effect(s), and its next direct attack deals 20% additional damage.", "Rally an ally with a thunderous call, healing it for 260% of your Strength or 365% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, increased by 10% for each Scent of Blood and Frostbite on all enemies, up to 80%. Removes 1 harmful effect(s), and its next direct attack deals 15% additional damage.", "Guards an ally for 2 turns and shields you for 220% of your Strength (310% of your Instinct if higher). The shield absorbs 40% of the direct damage your ally takes; the guard ends when it breaks. Consumes up to 2 Scents of Blood from the most marked enemy: +35% shield and +1 turn each.", "Guards an ally for 2 turns and shields you for 170% of your Strength (240% of your Instinct if higher). The shield absorbs 30% of the direct damage your ally takes; the guard ends when it breaks. Consumes up to 2 Scents of Blood from the most marked enemy: +35% shield and +1 turn each.", "Passive. Each enemy can carry up to 3 Scents of Blood. A Scent lasts 3 turns and each new one refreshes them. Your bleeds on a frostbitten target grant 1 Scent per turn. At 3 Scents the enemy is Hunted for 2 turns: it takes 15% more damage from your team and cannot avoid your attacks.", "Passive Aspect. Once per battle, when you fall below 40% Health, the ancestors take your body for 3 turns (\'Ancestral Form\'): +40% damage dealt, -25% damage taken, 100% immune to stuns. When it ends you are \'Spent\': -20% damage dealt for 2 turns. Unlocks Call of the Ancestors.", "Raise the blood moon for 3 turns. At the start of each of their turns, every enemy suffers 1 \'Wound\'. Your Wounds deal their damage twice and heal you for 30% of it. When the moon sets, every Wound on every enemy bursts at once for 100% of the bleeding it had left.", "Mokoshotar descends from the first wolves of the eternal winter, and its ancestors still hunt at its side. Every ability raised to its maximum rank awakens a Mastery effect, marked with a star. Passively increases your Health, Strength, Instinct and Speed by 10%.", "Passively allows you to track up to 3 Scent of Blood on each enemy. Your bleeding effects on frostbitten targets grant Scent each turn. Enemies with 3 Scent become Hunted, receiving 15% additional damage from your team and being unable to avoid your attacks.", "Deals 280% of your Strength and destroys 20 Focus (40 against a Hunted target). For 2 turns the target takes 15% more damage and has 25% less Speed. If it has a Scent of Blood, consumes 1: destroys 10 more Focus and blocks its Focus abilities for 2 turns.", "Deals 300% of your Strength as Ice damage (420% of your Instinct if higher). Stuns for 1 turn and applies 3 Frostbite. Cannot be avoided. Against 2+ Scents of Blood, consumes 2: the target loses 25 Focus at the start of each of its next 2 turns.", "Deals 260% of your Strength as Ice damage (364% of your Instinct if higher). Stuns for 1 turn and applies 2 Frostbite. Cannot be avoided. Against 2+ Scents of Blood, consumes 2: the target loses 20 Focus at the start of each of its next 2 turns.", "Share the primal breath of the pack for 3 turns: all allies regenerate 8 Focus each turn, gain 15% Speed and take 15% less damage. Consumes 1 Scent of Blood from each marked enemy, increasing the Focus regeneration by 2 for each, up to 8.", "Share the primal breath of the pack for 3 turns: all allies regenerate 6 Focus each turn, gain 10% Speed and take 10% less damage. Consumes 1 Scent of Blood from each marked enemy, increasing the Focus regeneration by 2 for each, up to 8.", "Heals an ally for 360% of your Strength (504% of your Instinct if higher) + 15% of its maximum Health, +10% per Scent of Blood and Frostbite in play (max +80%). Removes 2 harmful effects, and its next direct attack deals 25% more damage.", "Heals an ally for 310% of your Strength (434% of your Instinct if higher) + 12% of its maximum Health, +10% per Scent of Blood and Frostbite in play (max +80%). Removes 1 harmful effect, and its next direct attack deals 20% more damage.", "Heals an ally for 260% of your Strength (364% of your Instinct if higher) + 10% of its maximum Health, +10% per Scent of Blood and Frostbite in play (max +80%). Removes 1 harmful effect, and its next direct attack deals 15% more damage.", "Release a trail of frozen blood, dealing 140% of your Strength or 195% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage to all enemies. Applies 1 Frostbite and causes them to bleed for 25% of the same value each turn for 3 turns.", "Release a trail of frozen blood, dealing 110% of your Strength or 155% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage to all enemies. Applies 1 Frostbite and causes them to bleed for 20% of the same value each turn for 3 turns.", "Pounce on the enemy for 150% of your Strength, dealing 30% extra damage for each Scent of Blood on the target. Recovers 10 Focus per Scent and grants Blood Rush, increasing your direct damage by 5% for 3 turns. Stacks up to 3 times.", "Mark your prey and let the pack\'s howl echo, shielding all allies for 200% of your Strength or 280% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, for 2 turns. Consumes up to 2 Scent of Blood from the target: each grants a Pack Echo charge.", "Mark your prey and let the pack\'s howl echo, shielding all allies for 165% of your Strength or 230% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, for 2 turns. Consumes up to 2 Scent of Blood from the target: each grants a Pack Echo charge.", "Mark your prey and let the pack\'s howl echo, shielding all allies for 130% of your Strength or 180% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, for 2 turns. Consumes up to 2 Scent of Blood from the target: each grants a Pack Echo charge.", "Pounce on the enemy for 130% of your Strength, dealing 25% extra damage for each Scent of Blood on the target. Recovers 8 Focus per Scent and grants Blood Rush, increasing your direct damage by 5% for 3 turns. Stacks up to 3 times.", " of the bleeding it had left and is consumed. Grants you 1 \'Scent of Blood\' for every 2 Wounds consumed. With 3 or more consumed, the target suffers \'Hemorrhage\' for 2 turns: -20% Physical and Ice Defense, -15% damage dealt.", "Deals 145% of your Strength as Ice damage (203% of your Instinct if higher) for each Frostbite on the target (1 hit if it has none). Cannot be avoided. At 3+ Frostbite it consumes them all and dispels 2 beneficial effects.", "Deals 220% of your Strength as Ice damage (308% of your Instinct if higher). Stuns for 1 turn. Cannot be avoided. Against 2+ Scents of Blood, consumes 2: the target loses 15 Focus at the start of each of its next 2 turns.", "Deals 115% of your Strength as Ice damage (161% of your Instinct if higher) for each Frostbite on the target (1 hit if it has none). Cannot be avoided. At 3+ Frostbite it consumes them all and dispels 1 beneficial effect.", "Enemies bleeding from Rake or Cold Trail gain 1 Scent mark after a direct attack against your team, once per action. Maximum 2 marks; refreshed for 3 turns. The Scent counter shows marks/2. Only Echo Ward consumes marks.", "Deals 180% of your Strength as Ice damage (252% of your Instinct if higher) to all enemies and applies 1 Frostbite. For 3 turns they bleed for 10% of your Strength + 20% of your Instinct per turn and have 10% less Speed.", "Deals 160% of your Strength as Ice damage (224% of your Instinct if higher) to all enemies and applies 1 Frostbite. For 3 turns they bleed for 8% of your Strength + 16% of your Instinct per turn and have 10% less Speed.", "Deals 140% of your Strength as Ice damage (196% of your Instinct if higher) to all enemies and applies 1 Frostbite. For 3 turns they bleed for 6% of your Strength + 12% of your Instinct per turn and have 10% less Speed.", "Shatter a target afflicted by at least 3 Frostbite, consuming them to deal 115% of your Strength or 160% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage per stack and dispel 2 buffs. This attack cannot be avoided.", "Shatter a target afflicted by at least 3 Frostbite, consuming them to deal 90% of your Strength or 125% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage per stack and dispel 1 buff. This attack cannot be avoided.", "Passive. Your allies deal 6% more damage per Scent of Blood on their target (max 18%). Their hits on a Hunted target heal them for 15% of the damage dealt, and their critical hits extend the target\'s Scent by 1 turn.", "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 240% of your Strength or 335% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. Applies 3 Frostbite. This attack cannot be avoided.", "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 210% of your Strength or 295% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. Applies 2 Frostbite. This attack cannot be avoided.", "Passive Aspect. Enemies can carry up to 7 \'Frostbite\' (the 8th freezes them solid), Brittle adds 30% damage instead of 20%, and Shatter Guard counts up to 7. Your \'Wounds\' last 1 turn less. Unlocks Endless Winter.", "Gain 20% Strength and Instinct for 3 turns. Recover 12% Strength + 12% Instinct Health each turn, based on your attributes before transforming. Does not stack with Canine Instincts\' Strength and Instinct bonuses.", "Gain 30% Strength and Instinct for 3 turns. Recover 18% Strength + 18% Instinct Health each turn, based on your attributes before transforming. Does not stack with Canine Instincts\' Strength and Instinct bonuses.", "Target a living enemy. Consume up to 2 Scent marks to shield living allies for 60% Instinct plus 70% per mark, for 2 turns. Refreshes existing Echo Wards. No marks are consumed if nobody can receive the shield.", "Deal 70% Instinct as Ice damage to each living enemy. Each target uses its own Scent and Defence. Survivors bleed for 25% Instinct for 2 turns. Bleeding refreshes; it does not stack. Does not consume Scent.", "Deals 245% of your Strength as Ice damage (343% of your Instinct if higher). Applies 2 Frostbite (3 if the target is bleeding). For 5 turns the target has 10% less Ice Defense and receives 20% less healing.", "Deals 215% of your Strength as Ice damage (301% of your Instinct if higher). Applies 2 Frostbite (3 if the target is bleeding). For 5 turns the target has 10% less Ice Defense and receives 20% less healing.", "Deals 185% of your Strength as Ice damage (259% of your Instinct if higher). Applies 1 Frostbite (2 if the target is bleeding). For 5 turns the target has 10% less Ice Defense and receives 20% less healing.", "Deals 340% of your Strength, +80% per Scent of Blood on the target (consumes them all). +40% damage if the target is below 35% Health, +50% if it is Brittle; always a critical hit against a Brittle target.", "Encase an ally or yourself in ancestral ice for 1 turn: 100% stunned (loses its next turn), -90% damage taken, and cleansed of every harmful effect. When the ice breaks, it heals 15% of its maximum Health.", " \'Ice Shards\' (2 without this passive). Each Shard reduces the damage you take by 3% and recovers 2 Focus per turn. You gain Shards when you consume Frostbite (Shatter Guard) or freeze an enemy solid (+2).", "Execute the enemy for 280% of your Strength, consuming all Scent of Blood for an additional 80% per Scent. Deals 40% extra damage to targets below 35% Health and always critically strikes Brittle targets.", "Execute the enemy for 250% of your Strength, consuming all Scent of Blood for an additional 70% per Scent. Deals 40% extra damage to targets below 35% Health and always critically strikes Brittle targets.", "Execute the enemy for 220% of your Strength, consuming all Scent of Blood for an additional 60% per Scent. Deals 40% extra damage to targets below 35% Health and always critically strikes Brittle targets.", "Make a last stand, reducing damage taken by 70% and damage dealt by 20% for 1 turn. Consumes all Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy, reducing damage taken by an additional 5% for each, up to 85%.", "Make a last stand, reducing damage taken by 55% and damage dealt by 25% for 1 turn. Consumes all Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy, reducing damage taken by an additional 5% for each, up to 85%.", "Bite the enemy with ancestral frost for 230% of your Strength or 320% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage. Applies 1 Frostbite, plus 1 for each Scent of Blood on the target, up to 3.", "Bite the enemy with ancestral frost for 205% of your Strength or 285% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage. Applies 1 Frostbite, plus 1 for each Scent of Blood on the target, up to 3.", "Bite the enemy with ancestral frost for 180% of your Strength or 250% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage. Applies 1 Frostbite, plus 1 for each Scent of Blood on the target, up to 3.", "Protect another living ally for 2 turns. Redirect 35% of direct Health damage to yourself. Periodic damage is not redirected. Ends if the guardian dies; redirected damage cannot be redirected again.", " against a Hunted target). For 2 turns it takes 15% more damage and has 25% less Speed. If it carries a \'Scent of Blood\', consumes one: the target cannot use abilities that cost Focus for 2 turns.", "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 180% of your Strength or 250% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. This attack cannot be avoided.", "Passively reduces damage taken from damage-over-time effects by 30% and restores 5 Focus at the start of each of your turns. Consuming Scent of Blood removes 1 damage-over-time effect from you.", "Protect another ally for 2 turns, taking 25% of its direct Health damage. Gain a shield absorbing 24% Strength + 24% Instinct damage for 2 turns. Transferred damage cannot be redirected again.", "Protect another ally for 2 turns, taking 35% of its direct Health damage. Gain a shield absorbing 36% Strength + 36% Instinct damage for 2 turns. Transferred damage cannot be redirected again.", "Rend the enemy with frozen claws for 195% of your Strength or 275% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage, applying 2 Frostbite. The target receives 50% less healing for 2 turns.", "Rend the enemy with frozen claws for 170% of your Strength or 240% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage, applying 2 Frostbite. The target receives 40% less healing for 2 turns.", "Rend the enemy with frozen claws for 150% of your Strength or 210% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage, applying 1 Frostbite. The target receives 30% less healing for 2 turns.", "Sink your fangs into your own flesh: lose 10% of your current Health and suffer 2 \'Wounds\' yourself (15% of your Strength per turn each, 3 turns). For 3 turns you are in \'Killer Instinct\': +", "% of the direct damage your ally takes, and each enemy that strikes your ally gains 1 \'Frostbite\'. Consumes up to 2 \'Scent of Blood\' from the most marked enemy: +35% shield and +1 turn each.", "Clamp down on the enemy with iron jaws for 190% of your Strength, destroying 30 Focus. Consumes 1 Scent of Blood, if present, to destroy an additional 25 Focus. Focus can be reduced to 0.", "Clamp down on the enemy with iron jaws for 160% of your Strength, destroying 20 Focus. Consumes 1 Scent of Blood, if present, to destroy an additional 20 Focus. Focus can be reduced to 0.", "Marked by the ancestral wolves, Mokoshotar bears the blue runes of the eternal winter. This class passive is currently inactive and grants no bonus to Health, Strength, Instinct or Speed.", "% of the greater of (80% Strength + 40% Instinct) or (40% Strength + 80% Instinct) as Ice damage and stun the enemy for 2 turns. Consume 2 Scent to inflict Ancestral Dread, draining ", "Your Rake and Cold Trail bleeds immediately add 1 Scent. Your direct non-consuming attacks also mark bleeding enemies. Maximum 2 marks, lasting 3 turns. Once per target per action.", "Heal a friendly target for 108% Strength and 108% Instinct and remove one removable harmful effect. Grant Courage, increasing its next direct attack\'s damage by 20% within 2 turns.", "Heal a friendly target for 126% Strength and 126% Instinct and remove one removable harmful effect. Grant Courage, increasing its next direct attack\'s damage by 25% within 2 turns.", "Passive Aspect. Enemies can carry up to 7 \'Wounds\', and Rupture and Frost Fang consume up to 7. Every \'Frostbite\' you apply is reduced by 1 (minimum 1). Unlocks Blood Moon Rising.", "Awaken your undead instincts for 3 turns. Gain 25% Strength and recover Health equal to 25% of your Strength at application each turn. Reapplying refreshes the effect. Self only.", "Heal a friendly target for 90% Strength and 90% Instinct and remove one removable harmful effect. Grant Courage, increasing its next direct attack\'s damage by 15% within 2 turns.", "Strike an enemy for 112% Strength + 56% Instinct Physical damage and make it bleed for 20% Strength + 10% Instinct damage each turn for 3 turns. Reapplying refreshes the bleed.", "Strike an enemy for 128% Strength + 64% Instinct Physical damage and make it bleed for 24% Strength + 12% Instinct damage each turn for 3 turns. Reapplying refreshes the bleed.", "Strike an enemy for 144% Strength + 72% Instinct Physical damage and make it bleed for 28% Strength + 14% Instinct damage each turn for 3 turns. Reapplying refreshes the bleed.", "Rake the enemy for 205% of your Strength, causing it to bleed for 45% of your Strength each turn for 3 turns. Grants 1 Scent of Blood, or 2 if the target was already bleeding.", "Rake the enemy for 175% of your Strength, causing it to bleed for 35% of your Strength each turn for 3 turns. Grants 1 Scent of Blood, or 2 if the target was already bleeding.", "Dormant effect (inactive):\nPassively increases your Strength, Instinct, Speed and Health by 10%.\n\nAbilities at their maximum rank gain a Mastery effect that strengthens them.", "Passively increases your allies\' damage by 6% for each Scent of Blood on their target, up to 18%. Their attacks against Hunted targets heal them for 15% of the damage dealt.", "Deal 96% Strength + 192% Instinct Ice damage. Consume 1 Scent to inflict Frozen Reflex for 2 turns: the next eligible technique gains 2 extra turns of recharge after use.", "Deals 190% of your Strength, +30% per Scent of Blood on the target. Recovers 10 Focus per Scent. Grants Blood Rush: +5% direct damage for 3 turns, stacking up to 3 times.", "Passive. You take 25% less damage from damage over time and recover 5 Focus at the start of each of your turns. Consuming a Scent of Blood removes 1 such effect from you.", "Deal 72% Strength + 144% Instinct Ice damage. Consume 1 Scent to inflict Frozen Reflex for 2 turns: the next eligible technique gains 1 extra turn of recharge after use.", "Deal 84% Strength + 168% Instinct Ice damage. Consume 1 Scent to inflict Frozen Reflex for 2 turns: the next eligible technique gains 1 extra turn of recharge after use.", "Deals 165% of your Strength, +30% per Scent of Blood on the target. Recovers 8 Focus per Scent. Grants Blood Rush: +5% direct damage for 3 turns, stacking up to 3 times.", "Passive. Each enemy can carry up to 2 Scents of Blood. A Scent lasts 3 turns and each new one refreshes them. Your bleeds on a frostbitten target grant 1 Scent per turn.", "Passive. Once per battle, a blow that would kill you leaves you at 25% of your maximum Health, shielded for a further 20% for 2 turns, and free of every harmful effect.", "Deal 208% Strength + 104% Instinct Physical damage, increased by 40% against enemies below 35% Health. Consume up to 2 Scent to inflict No Escape for 1 turn per mark.", "Deal 160% Strength + 80% Instinct Physical damage, increased by 40% against enemies below 35% Health. Consume up to 2 Scent to inflict No Escape for 1 turn per mark.", "Deal 184% Strength + 92% Instinct Physical damage, increased by 40% against enemies below 35% Health. Consume up to 2 Scent to inflict No Escape for 1 turn per mark.", "Go for the throat, dealing 140% of your Strength and reducing the target\'s Physical and Ice Defense by 30% for 3 turns. Destroys 30 Focus. Focus can be reduced to 0.", "Go for the throat, dealing 120% of your Strength and reducing the target\'s Physical and Ice Defense by 20% for 3 turns. Destroys 20 Focus. Focus can be reduced to 0.", "% damage taken, and each enemy that strikes you with a direct attack gains 1 \'Frostbite\'. Consumes up to 3 \'Ice Shards\': 5% less damage taken for each (up to 40%).", "Once per combat, when you would die you survive with 25% of your maximum Health, gain a shield equal to 20% of your maximum Health and remove all harmful effects.", "Passively shields you for 10% of your maximum Health for each Scent of Blood or Frostbite you consume, up to 40%, for 2 turns. Increases healing received by 15%.", "Deal 52% Strength + 104% Instinct Ice damage to all living enemies. They bleed for 10% Strength + 20% Instinct damage each turn and lose 10% Speed for 2 turns.", "Deal 36% Strength + 72% Instinct Ice damage to all living enemies. They bleed for 6% Strength + 12% Instinct damage each turn and lose 10% Speed for 2 turns.", "Deal 44% Strength + 88% Instinct Ice damage to all living enemies. They bleed for 8% Strength + 16% Instinct damage each turn and lose 10% Speed for 2 turns.", "If the target had at least 2 Scent of Blood, it loses 25 Focus at the start of its next 2 turns, and all other enemies receive 1 Frostbite and lose 15 Focus.", "Deals 300% of your Strength, +80% per Scent of Blood on the target (consumes them all). +40% damage if the target is below 35% Health, +50% if it is Brittle.", "Deals 260% of your Strength, +80% per Scent of Blood on the target (consumes them all). +40% damage if the target is below 35% Health, +50% if it is Brittle.", "Awaken your undead instincts for 3 turns. Increases your Strength by 25% and restores Health equal to 25% of your Strength each turn. Only targets yourself.", "Enemies suffer 1 Wound at the start of each of their turns. Wounds deal their damage twice and heal the wolf for 30% of it. Every Wound bursts when it ends.", ", +80% damage for each \'Scent of Blood\' on it (consumed) and +25% for each \'Wound\' on it (not consumed). Deals 40% more damage to targets below 35% Health.", "Once per battle, survive lethal damage with 1 Health and gain a shield equal to 10% of your maximum Health for 1 turn. Further damage may still kill you.", "Share the ancestral frost with your allies for 3 turns: the first direct attack of each ally every turn applies 1 \'Frostbite\', and their attacks deal ", "Attack the enemy for 210% of your Strength as Ice damage. The wounds weaken the target\'s Ice Defence and reduce the healing they receive for 6 turns.", "Passive. Each Scent of Blood or Frostbite you consume shields you for 10% of your maximum Health (max 40%) for 2 turns. You receive 15% more healing.", "Ancestral frost: Speed reduced by 16% and damage dealt reduced by 12%. Frostbite stops at 5; any further Frostbite freezes the unit solid instead.", "Ancestral frost: Speed reduced by 20% and damage dealt reduced by 15%. Frostbite stops at 5; any further Frostbite freezes the unit solid instead.", "Ancestral frost: Speed reduced by 12% and damage dealt reduced by 9%. Frostbite stops at 5; any further Frostbite freezes the unit solid instead.", "Transform the enemy into a Were-Wolf for 3 turns. Increases their damage by 6000 and regenerates Health equal to 50% of your Strength each turn.", "Shield living allies for 60% Strength + 60% Instinct damage for 2 turns. Consume up to 2 Scent from an enemy to create shared Pack Echo charges.", "Shield living allies for 72% Strength + 72% Instinct damage for 2 turns. Consume up to 2 Scent from an enemy to create shared Pack Echo charges.", "Shield living allies for 84% Strength + 84% Instinct damage for 2 turns. Consume up to 2 Scent from an enemy to create shared Pack Echo charges.", "Against Brittle targets, damage is based on your Strength and Instinct combined. If this brings the target to 5 Frostbite, you recover 20 Focus.", "If 5 Frostbite were consumed, the target becomes Fragile, receiving 25% additional damage for 3 turns, and half of them spread to another enemy.", "Deals 235% of your Strength. The target bleeds for 45% of your Strength per turn for 3 turns. +1 Scent of Blood (+2 if it was already bleeding).", "Deals 200% of your Strength. The target bleeds for 35% of your Strength per turn for 3 turns. +1 Scent of Blood (+2 if it was already bleeding).", "Shields every ally for 200% of your Strength (280% of your Instinct if higher) for 2 turns and consumes up to 2 Scents of Blood from the target.", "Shields every ally for 165% of your Strength (231% of your Instinct if higher) for 2 turns and consumes up to 2 Scents of Blood from the target.", "Shields every ally for 130% of your Strength (182% of your Instinct if higher) for 2 turns and consumes up to 2 Scents of Blood from the target.", "For 1 turn you take 70% less damage and deal 20% less. Consumes all Scents of Blood from the most marked enemy: -5% damage taken each (max 85%).", "For 1 turn you take 55% less damage and deal 25% less. Consumes all Scents of Blood from the most marked enemy: -5% damage taken each (max 85%).", "Ancestral frost: Speed reduced by 4% and damage dealt reduced by 3%. Frostbite stops at 5; any further Frostbite freezes the unit solid instead.", "Ancestral frost: Speed reduced by 8% and damage dealt reduced by 6%. Frostbite stops at 5; any further Frostbite freezes the unit solid instead.", "Transform into an undead beast, increasing your Strength and Instinct by 35% and regenerating 12% of your maximum Health each turn for 3 turns.", "Attack the enemy for 220% of your Strength as Ice damage. Reduces their Speed by 25% and increases the damage they receive by 15% for 3 turns.", "Transform into an undead beast, increasing your Strength and Instinct by 25% and regenerating 8% of your maximum Health each turn for 3 turns.", "Deals 280% of your Strength as Ice damage (392% of your Instinct if higher). Applies 1 Frostbite, +1 per Scent of Blood on the target (max 3).", "Deals 250% of your Strength as Ice damage (350% of your Instinct if higher). Applies 1 Frostbite, +1 per Scent of Blood on the target (max 3).", "Deals 220% of your Strength as Ice 