 "Bless all living allies for 3 turns. Each recovers 15 Focus per turn, gains 10% Speed and takes 5% less damage. Does not stack.", "Each \'Scent of Blood\' you consume while transformed extends it by 1 turn (up to 2) and heals you for 5% of your maximum Health.", "If the target dies, the Focus cost is refunded and your next attack deals 10% additional damage per Scent consumed, up to 30%.", "Each Scent of Blood you consume during this effect extends it by 1 turn, up to 2, and heals you for 5% of your maximum Health.", "Against 2+ Scents it also loses 25 more Focus per turn for 2 turns, and every other enemy gets 1 Frostbite and loses 15 Focus.", "Deal 104% Strength + 52% Instinct Physical damage and recover 15 Focus on hit. Deal 20% more damage to enemies without Scent.", "Deal 120% Strength + 60% Instinct Physical damage and recover 20 Focus on hit. Deal 20% more damage to enemies without Scent.", "Passively shields you for 7% of your maximum Health for each Scent of Blood or Frostbite you consume, up to 35%, for 2 turns.", "Each Scent of Blood you consume while transformed extends it by 1 turn (up to 2) and heals you for 5% of your maximum Health.", "Enemies that already had Frostbite gain 1 more \'Frostbite\', and enemies that already had Wounds gain 2 \'Wounds\' instead of 1.", "Consuming 5 or more Wounds makes the Hemorrhage last 3 turns and leaves the target \'Torn\': +20% damage received for 2 turns.", "Passive Aspect. For the whole battle your allies gain 10% Strength, Instinct and Speed, and you deal 15% less direct damage.", "At 3 Blood Rush stacks the target also bleeds for 30% of your Strength per turn for 2 turns, and you gain 1 Scent of Blood.", "Attack the enemy for 180% of your Strength as Ice damage. The chilling howl of the ancestors stuns the target for 2 turns.", "Deal 115% Strength as Physical damage. Deal 30% more damage against a target with no Scent marks. Does not consume Scent.", "For 1 turn, take 65% less damage and deal 50% less damage. 